OL,3,AMiliband says UK had to 'call out'
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in West Bank before
OL,5,Ait was too late
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband says the
OL,8,FUK had to "call out" Israeli settlement
OL,9,Factivity in the West Bank before it was
OL,10,F"too late" to save the two-state
OL,11,Fsolution
OL,13,FHe tells the BBC the prospect of a
OL,14,FPalestinian state alongside Israel is
OL,15,F"being destroyed by the facts on the
OL,16,Fground"
OL,18,FHe also rejects the suggestion that
OL,19,FBritish sanctions could lead to
OL,20,Fincreased antisemitism for Jewish
OL,21,Fpeople in the UK
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
