OL,3,APaul Adams: British-Israeli relations
OL,4,Aat lowest ebb in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of the UK's consulate in
OL,7,FEast Jerusalem, which serves the West
OL,8,FBank and deals directly with the
OL,9,FPalestinian Authority in Ramallah, and
OL,10,Fthe removal of British representatives
OL,11,Ffrom the International Gaza Support
OL,12,FCentre, the body set up last year to
OL,13,Fco-ordinate stabilisation and relief
OL,14,Fefforts in the Gaza Strip, are very
OL,15,Fhostile moves.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
