OL,3,AMore flights delayed after hundreds
OL,4,Acancelled by air traffic control glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlight delays will continue on
OL,7,FWednesday after an air traffic control
OL,8,Fproblem in the UK cancelled nearly
OL,9,F2,000 flights.
OL,11,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,12,Faffected by the disruption which saw
OL,13,Fmore than 1,750 flights cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday and a further 153 axed on
OL,15,FWednesday, according to aviation
OL,16,Fanalytics firm Cirium.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
