OL,3,AMore flights delayed after hundreds
OL,4,Acancelled by air traffic control glitch
OL,5,
OL,6,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,7,Fblamed a technical glitch and its boss
OL,8,FMartin Rolfe apologised, saying there
OL,9,Fwould be a full investigation after the
OL,10,Ffirm admitted resolving the issue had
OL,11,Ftaken "longer than hoped".
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander has
OL,14,Fsummoned Rolfe to a meeting on
OL,15,FWednesday to answer questions about the
OL,16,Fdisruption and response.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
